                                    "verticalAlign": false,
                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Government</span></p>\n<h1>City of Chandler, AZ</h1>\n<p>With nearly 250,000 residents relying on it, the City of Chandler’s website needed to be more than functional—it had to be intuitive, reliable, and built for scale. By integrating critical systems that support the city’s daily operations, we delivered a seamless digital experience that empowers both residents and internal teams with clarity, efficiency, and ease of use.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button transparent\" href=\"https://www.chandleraz.gov\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\">View Website</a></p>\n"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
