                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "160",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">My Role</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">Led development efforts while acting as the bridge between stakeholders and the engineering team.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e470282370e13c83ff7528f17ed6004ef\">Led team of 3 developers</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb6231e00a415ce5fddc0cf05d540f514\">Primary technical contact for stakeholders</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1425ad5dc98acf4391cf6cfe3302be84\">Translated requirements into scalable solutions</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e27950e2413d94175a8ae5229f2687f98\">Oversaw architecture, integrations, and delivery</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "__typename": "ParagraphSection",
                        "id": "167",
                        "bgColor": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)",
                        "bgImage": {
                            "__typename": "MediaBackgroundImage",
                            "id": "13",
                            "mediaImage2": {
                                "url": "__ORIGIN__/sites/default/files/2026-07/noisy-texture-200x200-o39-d95-c-4ac1af-t1.png"
                            }
                        },
                        "bgImagePosition": "center center",
                        "bgImageRepeat": "repeat",
                        "bgImageSize": "auto",
                        "centerContent": false,
                        "fullWidth": false,
                        "margin": null,
                        "padding": "padding-top-bottom-60",
                        "sectionId": null,
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "164",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
                                    "col-lg-4"
                                ],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "163",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"h3\">The Problem</span></p>\n<p>The existing experience made it difficult for residents to quickly find what they needed.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0d161838a6db99ebcdd60a84900e048f\">Navigation built around departments, not users</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eab52efd7537924f39ba6773424ababff\">Outdated, content-heavy experience</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb490e998e54153345e464a94372a7e26\">Key services hard to find</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "166",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
                                    "col-lg-4"
                                ],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "165",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"h3\">The Approach</span></p>\n<p>We restructured both the experience and the underlying system to better serve users.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb854239720dc19a01127e4a7bbb95c9b\">Shifted to audience-based navigation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea9ae87bdb592b9c8625e41a2ceb70816\">Built flexible Drupal architecture</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e88d5bc88b73b8312bf12ab35e3010994\">Improved search and content structure</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e991c6dc45ebe16928340e0c2ac815c6e\">Integrated essential city systems</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "169",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
                                    "col-lg-4"
                                ],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "168",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"h3\">Key Wins</span></p>\n<p>Focused improvements led to a more intuitive and scalable platform.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e48c3c294dbe4ddad79d54d3d9141fd66\">Audience-first navigation (Residents, Business, Government)</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e345cbe35f2c7fe401a617d00c7e88d27\">Improved service discovery</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e279b568a9214ba407aa5c7d16a96cf85\">Scalable platform for future growth</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef9398283ad0372a00ef764d9cffb9e08\">Streamlined user experience</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
